'''Exoswarm''' are creatures found in [[Lahai-Roi]] that are formed from the remnants of the [[Exostrider]].

==Types==
===Soliskin===
{{Main|Soliskin}}

Soliskin are a unique type of Exoswarm formed from the Exostrider's neural structures that reside within [[Bjartr Woods]].

==Enemies==
{{Enemies by Category List|Exoswarm Enemies}}

==Descriptions==
{{Description|Biomechanical creatures formed from the Exostrider's cellular remnants. By mimicking herds and other lifeforms, they helped rebuild Lahai-Roi's ecosystem.|Glossary Excerpt}}

